### Test the Fixed Organizer Booking System
### This shows how the new system would work with proper ticket type tracking

POST https://kiwilanka.co.nz/Bookings/organizer-direct
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_ORGANIZER_JWT_TOKEN

{
  "eventId": 33,
  "firstName": "Test",
  "lastName": "Buyer", 
  "buyerEmail": "test@example.com",
  "mobile": "+64123456789",
  "seatNumbers": [],  // Optional - for general admission can be empty
  "ticketRequests": [
    {
      "ticketTypeId": 75,  // Standing (16+ years) (Early B.) - $75.00
      "quantity": 2,
      "ticketTypeName": "Standing (16+ years) (Early B.)"
    },
    {
      "ticketTypeId": 82,  // Kids Corner (4-12 years) - $10.00  
      "quantity": 1,
      "ticketTypeName": "Kids Corner (4-12 years)"
    }
  ]
}

### This request would create:
### - 3 BookingLineItems total
### - 2 with ItemId=75 (Standing tickets)
### - 1 with ItemId=82 (Kids ticket)
### - Each with proper ticket type tracking for availability calculation

### Expected Response:
# {
#   "bookingId": 999,
#   "paymentGUID": "ORG_xxxxx",
#   "message": "Organizer booking created successfully with 3 tickets across 2 ticket types...",
#   "eventName": "WAYO",
#   "seatNumbers": ["Standing (16+ years) (Early B.)-1", "Standing (16+ years) (Early B.)-2", "Kids Corner (4-12 years)-3"],
#   "ticketDetails": [...],
